      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/2879-thread-free-air-start\n\nConflicted files:\n- crates/motion/src/turning/thread.rs (thread_planned_in, k_hi): took\n  main's side. #2892 made the same change as `s_hi_pass =\n  f.station_of(p.top_z).max(s_hi)`; s_hi <= station_of(top_z) always, so\n  the value equals this branch's `s_top`. The file now equals main.\n\nMerged cleanly: crates/motion/src/turning/revolve.rs (main has the same\nw0/w1 removal; the file equals main).\n\nHand edit: docs/decisions/2879-thread-free-air-start.md item 2 says that\nmain's s_hi_pass form landed in #2892 and that this PR now adds the\nturning_thread_end_face pins.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
